2026-10-21: Dielectric volume feature revision 1 complete.

Self-consistent NEC conductor/dielectric volume coupling, dense/GMRES/FFT,
passive scalar loss and frequency tables, touching dielectric materials,
PEC-ground contact, and positive-gap GN 2 wires-first real ground.
M12 contact/penetration, anisotropy and broader ground modes remain deferred.
See docs/DIELECTRIC-REVISION-1-RELEASE.md and examples/dielectric-r1/README.md.
Upstream program version remains 1.3.

